% VALID certificate: min x + 0.5 y s.t. x + 0.5 y >= 1.25, x and y continuous, written with finite decimals as the
% spec allows; proves the lower bound 1.25.
VER 1.1
VAR 2
x y
INT 0
OBJ min
2 0 1 1 0.5
CON 1 0
C1 G 1.25 2 0 1.0 1 0.50
RTP range 1.25 inf
SOL 0
DER 1
D1 G 1.25 OBJ { lin 1 0 1.000 } -1
